 her childhood home - a little island in the heart of the majestic Canadian forest. Whilst there, she rescues two helpless cubs: a wolf and a lion. They forge an inseparable bond, but their world soon collapses as the forest ranger discovers the animals and takes them away. The two cub brothers must now embark on a treacherous journey across Canada to be reunited with one another and Alma once more.","tagline":"An unlikely friendship. An incredible adventure."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vo5jNATG0XGipXiQILhvLdaEczM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lKvMfb4A7AHy4UzIWzFR8vJbaeb.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":780382,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vo5jNATG0XGipXiQILhvLdaEczM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vo5jNATG0XGipXiQILhvLdaEczM.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vo5jNATG0XGipXiQILhvLdaEczM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vo5jNATG0XGipXiQILhvLdaEczM.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jYhIvSxRcZ2krgJRpjGfD3KQ3Me.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jYhIvSxRcZ2krgJRpjGfD3KQ3Me.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1428},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ni60dGiN6ycD2AFEMqITNxVGWIb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ni60dGiN6ycD2AFEMqITNxVGWIb.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cCXUEZJZqmUXw9owUefpwCrefoo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cCXUEZJZqmUXw9owUefpwCrefoo.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available"